Dialogue: 3,0:22:53.73,0:22:55.73,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}它於何時改變？
Dialogue: 3,0:22:55.73,0:22:57.48,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}曾經它鮮活如綠野
Dialogue: 3,0:22:58.02,0:22:59.86,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}如今它憂鬱似海藍
Dialogue: 3,0:23:03.90,0:23:06.49,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}落葉輕灑於地
Dialogue: 3,0:23:07.07,0:23:10.20,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}為何你觸碰它
Dialogue: 3,0:23:10.20,0:23:13.25,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}你要離我而去？
