Dialogue: 3,0:23:22.59,0:23:25.59,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}我試圖去理解
Dialogue: 3,0:23:27.76,0:23:29.43,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如缺失的線索
Dialogue: 3,0:23:29.43,0:23:31.01,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如我沉溺的海洋
Dialogue: 3,0:23:31.01,0:23:32.56,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如舊鞋
Dialogue: 3,0:23:32.56,0:23:35.69,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如那場讓我遇見你的旅程
Dialogue: 3,0:23:35.69,0:23:37.27,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如樹莓汁
Dialogue: 3,0:23:37.27,0:23:38.94,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}藍色如我心境
Dialogue: 3,0:23:41.73,0:23:43.94,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}現在 你去往了何處？
Dialogue: 3,0:23:43.94,0:23:46.99,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,250)}我曾如此了解你
Dialogue: 3,0:23:50.53,0:23:52.91,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(250,0)}你去往了何處？
